sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as KServe / Caikit Client
    participant Router as text-generation-router<br/>8033/TCP gRPC<br/>TLS 1.2+ (optional)
    participant Batch as Continuous Batching<br/>Engine (in-process)
    participant Shard0 as text-generation-server<br/>Shard 0 (Python)<br/>Unix Domain Socket
    participant ShardN as text-generation-server<br/>Shards 1..N
    participant GPU as GPU (CUDA 12.1)
    participant PVC as PVC Model Cache<br/>/shared_model_storage

    Note over Client, PVC: Flow 1: Text Generation Request (gRPC)
    Client->>Router: gRPC Generate/GenerateStream<br/>Optional mTLS, Bearer Token
    Router->>Router: Tokenize + Validate Input<br/>(HuggingFace tokenizer)
    Router->>Batch: Queue Request<br/>Continuous Batching
    Batch->>Shard0: gRPC Prefill (Unix socket)<br/>No encryption
    Shard0->>ShardN: NCCL AllReduce<br/>TCP/SHM/NVLink
    ShardN-->>Shard0: Tensor results
    Shard0-->>Batch: PrefillResponse
    loop Auto-regressive Decode
        Batch->>Shard0: gRPC NextToken (Unix socket)
        Shard0->>ShardN: NCCL AllReduce
        ShardN-->>Shard0: Tensor results
        Shard0-->>Batch: NextTokenResponse
    end
    Batch-->>Router: Complete Generation
    Router-->>Client: gRPC Response<br/>Optional TLS

    Note over Client, PVC: Flow 2: Health Probe
    participant Kubelet as Kubelet
    Kubelet->>Router: HTTP GET /health<br/>3000/TCP, No auth
    Router->>Shard0: gRPC Health (Unix socket)
    Shard0->>GPU: torch.zeros((2,2)).cuda()<br/>CUDA alloc check
    GPU-->>Shard0: OK
    Shard0-->>Router: Health OK
    Router-->>Kubelet: 200 OK

    Note over Client, PVC: Flow 3: Model Loading (Startup)
    participant Launcher as text-generation-launcher
    Launcher->>Shard0: Spawn process<br/>(CLI args + env)
    Launcher->>ShardN: Spawn process<br/>(CLI args + env)
    Shard0->>PVC: Load model weights<br/>safetensors format
    Shard0->>GPU: Transfer to GPU memory<br/>PyTorch CUDA
    ShardN->>GPU: Transfer to GPU memory
    Note over Shard0: Signal readiness via<br/>Unix socket file
    Launcher->>Router: Spawn router process
    Router->>Shard0: gRPC ModelInfo (Unix socket)<br/>Get memory scaling coefficients
